       A ThoughtStage is addressed by the handle built from its label, with any {...} stripped
       out. "showing off riches" appears six times, so each gets the handle plus its rank.
       "{0}" strips to nothing, so those six stages have no handle at all and the index is the
       right form for them. The {0} labels hold no text of their own: the reason that fills them
       is a keyed string, in Languages/French/Keyed. -->

